* VoxHenry input file
* Model type: copper cube 2x2x2 voxels (2e-006 m side), smallest test

* Frequency points (Hz)
freq= 1e+010

* Voxel size (m)
dx=1e-006

* Voxel grid dimension in voxel units; x, y, z
LMN=2,2,2

* Voxel list
* Format is:
* V <index_x> <index_y> <index_z> <conductivity S/m>
*
StartVoxelList
V 1 1 1 5.8e+007
V 2 1 1 5.8e+007
V 1 2 1 5.8e+007
V 2 2 1 5.8e+007
V 1 1 2 5.8e+007
V 2 1 2 5.8e+007
V 1 2 2 5.8e+007
V 2 2 2 5.8e+007
EndVoxelList

* Port nodes list
* Format is:
* N <portname> <excitation or ground (P/N)> <voxel_index_x> <voxel_index_y> <voxel_index_z> <node (+z,-z,+x,-x,+y,-y)>
*
N port1 P 2 1 1 +x
N port1 P 2 2 1 +x
N port1 P 2 1 2 +x
N port1 P 2 2 2 +x
N port1 N 1 1 1 -x
N port1 N 1 2 1 -x
N port1 N 1 1 2 -x
N port1 N 1 2 2 -x
